<title>UK: Seafield chief executive resigns.</title>
<headline>Seafield chief executive resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seafield Resources Plc said on Tuesday that David Keith has resigned as chief executive and was leaving the company.</p>
<p>It said that chairman John Raitt would take on the responsibilities of chief executive while the company sought a new chief executive.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
